{
  "format": "srwb",
  "version": "1.0",
  "notebook": {
    "name": "淹没矿井冷却：水–能权衡",
    "cells": [
      {
        "code": "# 淹没矿井冷却：水–能权衡\n\n*一个虚构的教学玩具模型——并非工程设计、选址评估、财务分析或实测性能声明。*\n\n一个标称 **10 MW 液冷数据中心**（9–10 MW 说明性小时负荷）通过诱导通风蒸发式冷却塔散热。静压箱将温热排气导流穿过连接至淹没矿井蓄热层的冷凝器盘管。回收的冷凝水可替代冷却塔的部分补给水。独立水回路在不发生混合的情况下进行换热。\n\n## 运行顺序和要求\n\n从上到下运行代码单元格：**simulation → classification → dashboard → dry_cooling → analysis_plots**。SciREPL 提供了 NumPy、Plotly 的 `mplot` 辅助工具、共享文件系统以及命名单元格 `nb_read`/`nb_write` API。Python 仿真将本地 CSV/事实文件写入 `/shared` 下，且仅更新指定的 `classification` 单元格。工作簿代码均不调用外部服务或 AI 提供商。在未捆绑内核的版本中，初始运行时安装可能需要下载。\n\n## 假设条件\n\n该矿井是一个具有恒定补给系数的完全混合蓄水层；不存在分层、地下水流动模型、季节性天气、水化学、健康评估或冷却塔控制优化。盘管的 UA/有效度公式提供了一个**玩具级传热预算**，而非经过校准的湿盘管设计。然后利用湿空气总焓（包括冷凝水带走的热焓）联立求解其出口温度与冷凝量。该传热量同样使矿井升温。\n\n热泵 COP、风机、水泵、干冷器逼近温差、电网水耗因子以及分类阈值均为声明的假设条件。热泵运行工况点仅重新计算一次而非充分迭代。单个高温周乘以每年周数仅用于**相同天气对比**，而非年度预测。干冷对比仅使用干热工况。\n\n用水指标结合了现场冷却塔补给水（蒸发、飘水和排污）与归属发电水耗。排污回流未被建模，因此该总和仅为说明性核算指标，而非一致的水资源消耗足迹。\n\n在解读结果之前，请检查各项假设、能量平衡残差、单位以及敏感性图表。低于羽流露点的冷蓄水层是冷凝的必要条件，但其本身并不是设备可行性或长期节水的证明。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "intro"
      },
      {
        "code": "import numpy as np, csv\n\n# ============ 说明性常数（玩具模型，无虚假精度） ============\nP_ATM  = 101.3          # kPa 大气压\nHOURS  = 168            # 一周，逐时\nDT     = 3600.0         # s 每小时\nCP_W   = 4.186          # kJ/kg-K 水\nCP_A   = 1.006          # kJ/kg-K 干空气\nIT_MEAN, IT_AMP = 9.5, 0.5        # MW IT 负荷昼夜变化计划（两种工况）\nT_MEAN,  T_AMP  = 32.0, 7.0       # degC 干球温度昼夜变化计划（两种工况）\nRH_SCHED = {'hot_dry': (27.5, 7.5), 'hot_humid': (65.0, 10.0)}  # % 均值，振幅\n\nTOWER_EFF  = 0.70       # 恒定冷却塔有效度\nAIR_PER_MW = 55.0       # kg 干空气/s 每 MW IT（诱导通风风机计划）\nM_WATER    = 420.0      # kg/s 冷却塔水设计流量\nCOC        = 5.0        # 浓缩倍数\nDRIFT_FRAC = 2.0e-5     # 飘水占循环水比例\nFAN_ETA, COIL_DP, RHO_AIR = 0.6, 50.0, 1.15   # 风机效率、盘管压降 Pa\n\nT_FAC_LIMIT = 27.0      # degC 说明性设施供水限制（W27级）\nHX_APPROACH = 3.0       # K 换热器逼近温差\n\nCOIL_UA   = 600.0       # kW/K 固定、宽片距翅片管盘管\nCOIL_APP  = 2.0         # K 盘管表面高于矿井水的逼近温差\nM_MINE    = 100.0       # kg/s 矿井回路流量\nPUMP_HEAD, PUMP_ETA = 15.0, 0.75\nT_MINE0, T_ROCK = 12.0, 12.0      # degC 矿井初始 / 远场围岩\nV_MINE    = 3.0e5       # m3 有效蓄水层体积\nU_LOSS    = 200.0       # kW/K 向岩石和地下水的补给/损失\n\n# ============ 湿空气性质 ============\ndef psat(T):            # 饱和水汽压，kPa (Magnus/Alduchov-Eskridge)\n    return 0.61094*np.exp(17.625*T/(T+243.04))\ndef w_of(T, RH):        # 含湿量 kg/kg 干空气\n    pv = RH/100.0*psat(T); return 0.62198*pv/(P_ATM-pv)\ndef w_sat(T): return w_of(T, 100.0)\ndef tdp_of_w(w):        # 根据含湿量计算露点，degC\n    pv = w*P_ATM/(0.62198+w); a = np.log(pv/0.61094)\n    return 243.04*a/(17.625-a)\ndef twb_stull(T, RH):   # 湿球温度，Stull (2011) 经验近似\n    RH = np.clip(RH, 1.0, 100.0)\n    return (T*np.arctan(0.151977*(RH+8.313659)**0.5) + np.arctan(T+RH)\n            - np.arctan(RH-1.676331) + 0.00391838*RH**1.5*np.arctan(0.023101*RH) - 4.686035)\ndef h_air(T, w):        # 湿空气焓 kJ/kg 干空气\n    return CP_A*T + w*(2501.0 + 1.86*T)\n\ndef plume(Tdb, RH, Q_kw, m_air):\n    \"\"\"通过湿空气能量平衡（二分法）捕集近饱和冷却塔排气。\"\"\"\n    w_in = w_of(Tdb, RH)\n    h_t  = h_air(Tdb, w_in) + Q_kw/m_air\n    lo, hi = twb_stull(Tdb, RH), 60.0\n    for _ in range(40):\n        mid = 0.5*(lo+hi)\n        if h_air(mid, 0.98*w_sat(mid)) < h_t: lo = mid\n        else: hi = mid\n    Tp = 0.5*(lo+hi); w_p = 0.98*w_sat(Tp)\n    return w_in, Tp, w_p, tdp_of_w(w_p)\n\ndef plume_condenser(Tp, w_p, Tm, m_air):\n    \"\"\"基于能量限制的玩具盘管，而非经过校准的湿盘管/几何模型。\n\n    湿空气焓采用 0 degC 液态水作为基准。冷凝水\n    在出口空气温度下离开，因此扣除其液体焓。\n    返回传递给矿井的总热量、出口温度/湿度、总\n    冷凝量以及能量平衡残差。\n    \"\"\"\n    if m_air <= 0.0:\n        raise ValueError(\"说明性盘管需要正向气流\")\n    surface = Tm + COIL_APP\n    if Tp <= surface:\n        return 0.0, Tp, w_p, 0.0, 0.0\n\n    def outlet(T):\n        w_out = min(w_p, w_sat(T))\n        condensed = m_air * max(0.0, w_p - w_out)\n        total_heat = (m_air * (h_air(Tp, w_p) - h_air(T, w_out))\n                      - condensed * CP_W * T)\n        return total_heat, w_out, condensed\n\n    # 保留基于 UA 的简单传热预算。明确限制其上限\n    # 不超过空气侧逼近极限和矿井回路热容。\n    c_min = min(m_air * (CP_A + 1.86 * w_p), M_MINE * CP_W)\n    eff_c = 1.0 - np.exp(-COIL_UA / c_min)\n    budget = eff_c * c_min * (Tp - surface)\n    max_air, _, _ = outlet(surface)\n    max_water = M_MINE * CP_W * (Tp - surface)\n    target = max(0.0, min(budget, max_air, max_water))\n    lo, hi = surface, Tp\n    for _ in range(50):\n        mid = 0.5 * (lo + hi)\n        if outlet(mid)[0] > target:\n            lo = mid\n        else:\n            hi = mid\n    T_out = 0.5 * (lo + hi)\n    Qc, w_out, condensed = outlet(T_out)\n    return Qc, T_out, w_out, condensed, Qc - target\n\n# ============ 仿真 ============\nrng = np.random.default_rng(7)\nh   = np.arange(HOURS)\nit_kw = (IT_MEAN + IT_AMP*np.sin(2*np.pi*(h-9)/24))*1000.0 + rng.normal(0, 15, HOURS)\ntdb   = T_MEAN + T_AMP*np.sin(2*np.pi*(h-15)/24) + rng.normal(0, 0.3, HOURS)\n\nKEYS = ['tdb','rh','twb','tcold','thot','plume_dp','mine_t','base_mu','mu_after',\n        'rec','fan_pen','pump','hp','extra','hp_on','cond_ok',\n        'plume_t','plume_w','out_t','out_w','mine_in','qc','evap','condensate','coil_resid_kw']\ncases, SUM = {}, {}\nfor name,(rhm,rha) in RH_SCHED.items():\n    rh = rhm - rha*np.sin(2*np.pi*(h-15)/24) + rng.normal(0, 1.0, HOURS)\n    d = {k: np.zeros(HOURS) for k in KEYS}\n    Tm = T_MINE0\n    for i in range(HOURS):\n        m_air = AIR_PER_MW*it_kw[i]/1000.0          # 诱导通风风机运行计划\n        twb   = twb_stull(tdb[i], rh[i])\n        Q     = it_kw[i]                            # 排入冷却塔回路的 IT 热量\n        rng_K = Q/(M_WATER*CP_W)                    # 由排热量得出的冷却塔幅宽\n        tcold = twb + rng_K*(1.0-TOWER_EFF)/TOWER_EFF\n        hp = 0.0\n        if tcold + HX_APPROACH > T_FAC_LIMIT:       # 被动式换热器能力不足 -> 启用冷水机组\n            lift  = tcold + HX_APPROACH - T_FAC_LIMIT\n            cop   = min(6.0, max(3.0, 6.5 - 0.25*lift))\n            hp    = Q/cop\n            Q     = Q + hp                          # 压缩机热量进入冷却塔回路\n            rng_K = Q/(M_WATER*CP_W)                # 仅重新计算一次，无循环\n            tcold = twb + rng_K*(1.0-TOWER_EFF)/TOWER_EFF\n        thot = tcold + rng_K\n        w_in, Tp, w_p, Tdp = plume(tdb[i], rh[i], Q, m_air)\n        evap  = m_air*(w_p - w_in)\n        drift = DRIFT_FRAC*M_WATER\n        blow  = max(0.0, evap/(COC - 1.0) - drift)  # 飘水也会带走溶解性固体\n        base  = evap + drift + blow\n        # ---- 闭式矿井回路上的羽流冷凝器（无混合） ----\n        mine_in = Tm\n        Qc, T_out, w_out, condensate, residual = plume_condenser(Tp, w_p, Tm, m_air)\n        # 补给水抵扣上限为冷却塔的蒸发量。总冷凝量\n        # 可能包含环境湿度；这并不追踪水的来源。\n        rec = min(max(0.0, evap), max(0.0, condensate))\n        Tm += (Qc - U_LOSS*(Tm - T_ROCK))*DT/(V_MINE*1000.0*CP_W)\n        fan_pen = COIL_DP*(m_air/RHO_AIR)/FAN_ETA/1000.0   # 盘管压降惩罚功耗，kW\n        pump    = 9.81*M_MINE*PUMP_HEAD/PUMP_ETA/1000.0\n        vals = [tdb[i],rh[i],twb,tcold,thot,Tdp,Tm,base,max(0.0,base-rec),rec,\n                fan_pen,pump,hp,fan_pen+pump+hp,float(hp>0),float(rec>0),\n                Tp,w_p,T_out,w_out,mine_in,Qc,evap,condensate,residual]\n        for k,v in zip(KEYS, vals): d[k][i] = v\n    cases[name] = d\n    it_tot  = it_kw.sum(); base_tot = d['base_mu'].sum(); rec_tot = d['rec'].sum()\n    SUM[name] = dict(save=100*rec_tot/base_tot, extra=100*d['extra'].sum()/it_tot,\n                     maxt=d['mine_t'].max(), condh=int(d['cond_ok'].sum()),\n                     hph=int(d['hp_on'].sum()), base_ml=base_tot*DT/1e6,\n                     after_ml=d['mu_after'].sum()*DT/1e6, rec_ml=rec_tot*DT/1e6,\n                     wue_b=base_tot*DT/it_tot, wue_a=d['mu_after'].sum()*DT/it_tot)\n\n# ============ 输出文件 ============\nfacts = \"\".join(f\"case_result({n}, {s['save']:.1f}, {s['extra']:.1f}, {s['maxt']:.1f}, {s['condh']}).\\n\"\n                for n,s in SUM.items())\nwith open('/shared/mine_cooling.csv','w',newline='') as f:\n    wtr = csv.writer(f); wtr.writerow(['case','hour']+KEYS)\n    for name,d in cases.items():\n        for i in range(HOURS): wtr.writerow([name,i]+[round(float(d[k][i]),4) for k in KEYS])\nwith open('/shared/mine_cooling_status.pl','w') as f:\n    f.write(facts)\n\n# 仅刷新指定 Prolog 单元格中的标记事实块。\n# 翻译工作簿时保持单元格名称和标记不变。\npl = nb_read('classification', '.code')\npl = pl[:pl.index('% FACTS-BEGIN')] + '% FACTS-BEGIN\\n' + facts + pl[pl.index('% FACTS-END'):]\nnb_write('classification', '.code', pl)\n\nfor name,s in SUM.items():\n    print(f\"{name}: 最大盘管能量残差 {np.max(np.abs(cases[name]['coil_resid_kw'])):.2e} kW\")\n    print(f\"{name}: 节水 {s['save']:.0f}% (WUE {s['wue_b']:.2f}->{s['wue_a']:.2f} L/kWh), \"\n          f\"额外能耗 {s['extra']:.1f}%, 最高矿井温度 {s['maxt']:.1f}C, 冷凝 {s['condh']}h, HP {s['hph']}h\")\n",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "python",
        "name": "simulation"
      },
      {
        "code": ":- dynamic case_result/5.\n:- retractall(case_result(_, _, _, _, _)).\n% FACTS-BEGIN\n% 先运行 simulation：它写入此标记事实块。\n% FACTS-END\n\n% 以下阈值均为说明性教学选择，而非工程准则。\nclassify(Case, Class) :-\n    case_result(Case, Save, Energy, MaxT, CondH),\n    (   CondH < 8.4                       % < 168 个模拟小时的 5%\n    ->  Class = no_condensation\n    ;   MaxT >= 28.0\n    ->  Class = thermal_limit\n    ;   (Save < 10.0 ; Energy > 5.0)\n    ->  Class = marginal\n    ;   Class = promising_toy_result\n    ).\n\nreport(Case) :-\n    classify(Case, Class),\n    case_result(Case, Save, Energy, _, _),\n    format(\"~w: ~w | 节水 ~1f% | 额外能耗 ~1f%~n\",\n           [Case, Class, Save, Energy]).\n\n( case_result(_, _, _, _, _)\n-> report(hot_dry), report(hot_humid)\n;  writeln(\"请在此 classification 单元格之前运行 simulation 单元格。\") ).\n",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "classification"
      },
      {
        "code": "import copy, textwrap\n\ndef _cooling_plot_layout(layout):\n    result = copy.deepcopy(layout)\n    result['height'] = 600\n    result['margin'] = {'t': 200, 'b': 180, 'l': 90, 'r': 90}\n    title = result.get('title', {})\n    if isinstance(title, str):\n        title = {'text': title}\n    title['text'] = '<br>'.join(textwrap.wrap(str(title.get('text', '')), width=45))\n    title.update({'x': 0.5, 'xanchor': 'center', 'y': 0.99, 'yanchor': 'top', 'pad': {'t': 30}})\n    result['title'] = title\n    result.setdefault('legend', {}).update({'orientation': 'v', 'x': 0, 'y': 1.12,\n                                         'xanchor': 'left', 'yanchor': 'bottom'})\n    for note in result.get('annotations', []):\n        if 'text' in note:\n            note['text'] = '<br>'.join(textwrap.wrap(str(note['text']), width=45))\n        if note.get('yref') == 'paper' and note.get('y', 0) < 0:\n            note['y'] = -0.28\n            note['yanchor'] = 'top'\n    return result\n\nhr = list(range(HOURS))\nnames = {'hot_dry': '#d62728', 'hot_humid': '#1f77b4'}\n\n# --- 图表 1：水量平衡对比 ---\nt1, xcats = [], ['基准补给水', '回收后', '回收的冷凝水']\nfor c in ['hot_dry', 'hot_humid']:\n    s = SUM[c]\n    t1.append({'x': xcats,\n               'y': [s['base_ml'], s['after_ml'], s['rec_ml']],\n               'type': 'bar',\n               'name': f\"{c} (节水 {s['save']:.0f}%, +{s['extra']:.1f}% 能耗)\",\n               'marker': {'color': names[c]}})\nmplot(t1, layout=_cooling_plot_layout({'barmode': 'group',\n                  'title': {'text': '每周冷却塔补给水量（10 MW IT，玩具模型）'},\n                  'yaxis': {'title': '水量 (ML)'},\n                  'legend': {'orientation': 'h', 'y': -0.2}}))\n\n# --- 图表 2：逐时羽流露点与矿井水温对比 ---\nt2 = []\nfor c, dash in [('hot_dry', 'solid'), ('hot_humid', 'dot')]:\n    t2.append({'x': hr, 'y': list(cases[c]['plume_dp']), 'type': 'scatter',\n               'mode': 'lines', 'name': f'{c} 羽流露点 (°C)',\n               'line': {'color': names[c], 'dash': dash, 'width': 2}})\n    t2.append({'x': hr, 'y': list(cases[c]['mine_t']), 'type': 'scatter',\n               'mode': 'lines', 'name': f'{c} 矿井水 (°C)',\n               'line': {'color': names[c], 'width': 3},\n               'opacity': 0.55})\nmplot(t2, layout=_cooling_plot_layout({'height': 480, 'title': {'text': '冷凝驱动力：羽流露点与矿井水'},\n                  'xaxis': {'title': '周内小时'},\n                  'yaxis': {'title': '温度 (°C)'},\n                  'legend': {'orientation': 'v', 'x': 0, 'y': 1.02,\n                             'xanchor': 'left', 'yanchor': 'bottom'},\n                  'margin': {'t': 140, 'b': 110},\n                  'annotations': [{'xref': 'paper', 'yref': 'paper', 'x': 0, 'y': -0.32, 'yanchor': 'top',\n                                   'showarrow': False, 'font': {'size': 11},\n                                   'text': ('玩具模型：结果取决于天气、换热器设计、 '\n                                            '矿井水力学、风机和热泵假设，以及长期 '\n                                            '热补给。')}]}))\n",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "python",
        "name": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "code": "# ===== 干冷对比 + 上游（源头）水耗 —— 复用 simulation 变量 =====\n# 历史/参考来源已在末尾的 Markdown 单元格中引用。\n# 所有系数和设备效率仍为可编辑的玩具级假设。\nimport numpy as np, csv\n\nANN = 52.1429            # 周/年 —— 年化模拟周（非全年气象运行）\n\n# ---- 声明的玩具级假设（与湿式基准具有相同的 IT 负荷、散热量、气候、小时数） ----\nTOWER_FAN_SP    = 125.0  # Pa 诱导通风冷却塔风机静压\nTOWER_PUMP_HEAD = 20.0   # m 冷却塔回路水泵扬程\nOVERHEAD_FRAC   = 0.05   # 非冷却设施开销 (UPS、照明) / IT\nT_RETURN        = 37.0   # degC 设施回路回水温度\nCHILL_ETA       = 0.42   # 风冷冷水机组：卡诺 COP 的比例\nT_EVAP_K        = 280.0  # K 冷水机组蒸发器 (~7 degC)\nCOND_APP        = 12.0   # K 冷水机组冷凝高于环境的逼近温差\nCHW_PUMP_FRAC   = 0.01   # 冷冻水泵 / 供冷负荷\nDC_APPROACH     = 5.0    # K 干冷器逼近温差（回路供水 - 环境）\nDC_FAN_FRAC     = 0.04   # 干冷器风机功率 / 排热量\nDC_PUMP_FRAC    = 0.01   # 干冷器回路泵 / 排热量\nASSIST_ETA      = 0.40   # 调峰机械辅助：卡诺 COP 的比例\nADIABATIC       = False  # 可选绝热辅助；OFF => 干冷工况直接耗水量为零\n\nGRID_WI = 4.35           # L/kWh 可配置；2023 年美国供电参考值 (LBNL)，\n                         # 包含分配给水电的水库蒸发 —— 核算选择\nWI_CASES = {'US grid 2023 ref (incl. hydro reservoirs)': 4.35,\n            'wet-cooled natural-gas CC': 0.776, 'wet-cooled coal': 2.60,\n            'wet-cooled nuclear': 2.54, 'utility solar PV': 0.0038,\n            'wind (~0)': 0.0, 'custom local grid': 1.50}\n\nq      = it_kw                                   # kW 散热量 = IT 负荷\nm_air  = AIR_PER_MW*q/1000.0\nhp_wet = cases['hot_dry']['hp']                  # 条件热泵（湿式系统）\n\n# ---- 湿式基准与矿井回收耗电量 ----\ntower_fan  = TOWER_FAN_SP*(m_air/RHO_AIR)/FAN_ETA/1000.0\ntower_pump = 9.81*M_WATER*TOWER_PUMP_HEAD/PUMP_ETA/1000.0*np.ones(HOURS)\nwet_cool   = tower_fan + tower_pump + hp_wet\nmine_cool  = wet_cool + cases['hot_dry']['fan_pen'] + cases['hot_dry']['pump']  # hp 不变\n\n# ---- 1) 常规风冷冷水机组：COP 随环境及温升 (K) 变化 ----\nlift_ch    = (tdb + COND_APP + 273.15) - T_EVAP_K          # 冷凝 - 蒸发，K\ncop_chiller = np.clip(CHILL_ETA*T_EVAP_K/lift_ch, 2.0, 6.0)\nchiller_cool = q/cop_chiller + CHW_PUMP_FRAC*q\n\n# ---- 2) 温水干冷器：当环境 + 逼近温差满足回路限制时仅运行风机 ----\ndT_need  = tdb + DC_APPROACH - T_FAC_LIMIT\nfan_only = dT_need <= 0.0\nf_assist = np.clip(dT_need/(T_RETURN - T_FAC_LIMIT), 0.0, 1.0)   # 需要辅助调节的负荷比例\ncop_assist = np.clip(ASSIST_ETA*(T_FAC_LIMIT - 2 + 273.15) /\n                     np.maximum(tdb + COND_APP - (T_FAC_LIMIT - 2), 2.0), 3.0, 10.0)\ndc_cool = (DC_FAN_FRAC + DC_PUMP_FRAC)*q + f_assist*q/cop_assist\n\nE_IT   = q.sum()                                  # kWh 每模拟周\nE_over = OVERHEAD_FRAC*E_IT\nSCEN = {'wet baseline':      dict(cool=wet_cool,    w_site=SUM['hot_dry']['base_ml']),\n        'mine vapour recovery': dict(cool=mine_cool, w_site=SUM['hot_dry']['after_ml']),\n        'air-cooled chiller':  dict(cool=chiller_cool, w_site=0.0),\n        'warm-water dry cooler': dict(cool=dc_cool,   w_site=0.0)}\nif ADIABATIC:  # 仅在显式启用时\n    SCEN['air-cooled chiller']['w_site']  = 0.25*SUM['hot_dry']['base_ml']\n    SCEN['warm-water dry cooler']['w_site'] = 0.25*SUM['hot_dry']['base_ml']\n\nR = {}\nfor nm, sc in SCEN.items():\n    E_cool = sc['cool'].sum(); E_fac = E_IT + E_cool + E_over     # E_facility = PUE*E_IT\n    W_site = sc['w_site']*ANN*1e6                                 # L/yr\n    W_up   = E_fac*ANN*GRID_WI                                    # L/yr（上游运行水耗）\n    R[nm] = dict(cool_mwh=E_cool*ANN/1e3, fac_mwh=E_fac*ANN/1e3, pue=E_fac/E_IT,\n                 w_site=W_site/1e6, w_up=W_up/1e6, wue_site=W_site/(E_IT*ANN),\n                 wue_src=(W_site+W_up)/(E_IT*ANN),\n                 d_fac=0.0, ons_saved=0.0, inc_up=0.0, net_saved=0.0, frac_up=0.0)\nbw = R['wet baseline']\nfor nm, r in R.items():\n    if nm == 'wet baseline': continue\n    r['d_fac']      = 100*(r['fac_mwh']-bw['fac_mwh'])/bw['fac_mwh']\n    r['ons_saved']  = bw['w_site'] - r['w_site']\n    r['inc_up']     = (r['fac_mwh']-bw['fac_mwh'])*1e3*GRID_WI/1e6   # ML/yr\n    r['net_saved']  = r['ons_saved'] - r['inc_up']\n    r['frac_up']    = 100*r['inc_up']/r['ons_saved']\n\n# ---- 工作簿矿井回收“extra energy”的分母验证 ----\nex_kwh = cases['hot_dry']['extra'].sum()         # 盘管风机功耗惩罚 + 矿井泵 + 热泵\nE_fac_mine = E_IT + mine_cool.sum() + E_over\nprint(f\"分母校验 — 工作簿矿井额外能耗 = {SUM['hot_dry']['extra']:.1f}% \"\n      f\"= (盘管风机功耗惩罚 + 矿井泵 + 热泵) / IT 用电量，模拟周\")\nprint(f\"  = {100*ex_kwh/E_fac_mine:.2f}% 的设施用电量 | dPUE +{ex_kwh/E_IT:.3f} \"\n      f\"| {ex_kwh*ANN/1e3:,.0f} MWh/年（基于重复高温周基准）\")\nprint(f\"干冷器运行：仅风机 {int(fan_only.sum())} 小时，机械辅助 {int((~fan_only).sum())} h \"\n      f\"(共 {HOURS} 小时）；风冷冷水机组运行全部 {HOURS} 小时；干冷工况直接耗水量 = 0 (adiabatic off)\\n\")\nprint(f\"对比（年化 x{ANN:.1f}；上游取 GRID_WI={GRID_WI} L/kWh，包含水电水库的美国 2023 年参考值）\")\nhdr = f\"{'scenario':<23}{'coolMWh':>9}{'facMWh':>9}{'PUE':>6}{'onsiteML':>9}{'upstrML':>9}{'WUEsite':>8}{'WUEsrc':>7}{'dFac%':>7}{'shift%':>7}\"\nprint(hdr); print('-'*len(hdr))\nfor nm, r in R.items():\n    print(f\"{nm:<23}{r['cool_mwh']:>9,.0f}{r['fac_mwh']:>9,.0f}{r['pue']:>6.3f}{r['w_site']:>9,.0f}\"\n          f\"{r['w_up']:>9,.0f}{r['wue_site']:>8.2f}{r['wue_src']:>7.2f}{r['d_fac']:>7.1f}{r['frac_up']:>7.1f}\")\nprint(\"\\n相比湿式基准的净补水加耗电水指标减少量（相同天气外推）\")\nfor nm, r in R.items():\n    if nm != 'wet baseline':\n        print(f\"{nm}: {r['net_saved']:.1f} ML/年；设施能耗变化 {r['d_fac']:+.1f}%\")\nprint(\"降低设施能耗与降低所定义的用水核算指标是各自独立的目标；请两者兼顾审视。\")\n\nwith open('/shared/dry_cooling_hourly.csv','w',newline='') as f:\n    wtr = csv.writer(f)\n    wtr.writerow(['hour','tdb','it_kw','wet_cool_kw','mine_cool_kw','chiller_kw','chiller_cop',\n                  'drycooler_kw','assist_frac','assist_cop','fan_only'])\n    for i in range(HOURS):\n        wtr.writerow([i, round(float(tdb[i]),2), round(float(q[i]),1), round(float(wet_cool[i]),1),\n                      round(float(mine_cool[i]),1), round(float(chiller_cool[i]),1),\n                      round(float(cop_chiller[i]),2), round(float(dc_cool[i]),1),\n                      round(float(f_assist[i]),3), round(float(cop_assist[i]),2), bool(fan_only[i])])\nwith open('/shared/water_energy_summary.csv','w',newline='') as f:\n    wtr = csv.writer(f); wtr.writerow(['scenario']+list(next(iter(R.values())).keys()))\n    for nm, r in R.items(): wtr.writerow([nm]+[round(v,4) for v in r.values()])\n",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "python",
        "name": "dry_cooling"
      },
      {
        "code": "# ===== 水–能图表：现场与上游对比、权衡、电网水耗强度敏感性 =====\nscen_order = ['wet baseline', 'mine vapour recovery', 'air-cooled chiller', 'warm-water dry cooler']\ncolors = {'wet baseline': '#1f77b4', 'mine vapour recovery': '#2ca02c',\n          'air-cooled chiller': '#d62728', 'warm-water dry cooler': '#ff7f0e'}\n\n# --- 1) 堆叠现场 + 上游水量 ---\ntr_site = {'x': scen_order, 'y': [R[s]['w_site'] for s in scen_order], 'type': 'bar',\n           'name': '现场（冷却塔补给水）', 'marker': {'color': '#1f77b4'}}\ntr_up   = {'x': scen_order, 'y': [R[s]['w_up'] for s in scen_order], 'type': 'bar',\n           'name': f'上游电力 (@ {GRID_WI} L/kWh)', 'marker': {'color': '#9467bd'}}\nmplot([tr_site, tr_up], layout=_cooling_plot_layout({'barmode': 'stack',\n    'title': {'text': f'年化现场补给水加归属发电耗水（ML/年；电网 {GRID_WI} L/kWh)'},\n    'yaxis': {'title': '水量 (ML/年)'}, 'legend': {'orientation': 'h', 'y': -0.25}}))\n\n# --- 2) 水–能权衡 ---\ntr_pts = []\nfor s in scen_order[1:]:\n    r = R[s]\n    tr_pts.append({'x': [r['d_fac']], 'y': [r['net_saved']], 'type': 'scatter',\n                   'mode': 'markers+text', 'name': s, 'text': [s], 'textposition': 'top center', 'cliponaxis': False,\n                   'marker': {'color': colors[s], 'size': 16}})\ntr_pts.append({'x': [0.0], 'y': [0.0], 'type': 'scatter', 'mode': 'markers',\n               'name': 'wet baseline', 'marker': {'color': colors['wet baseline'], 'size': 14,\n               'symbol': 'x'}})\nmplot(tr_pts, layout=_cooling_plot_layout({'title': {'text': '权衡：用水核算削减量与额外设施能耗'},\n    'xaxis': {'title': '相比湿式基准的设施能耗增加量 (%)'},\n    'yaxis': {'title': '用水核算削减量 (ML/年)'},\n    'legend': {'orientation': 'h', 'y': -0.2}}))\n\n# --- 3) 敏感性：现场节水量转移至上游的比例与电网水耗强度 ---\nwi_sweep = [i*0.25 for i in range(21)]          # 0..5 L/kWh\ntr_s = []\nfor s in scen_order[1:]:\n    r = R[s]\n    frac = [100*((r['fac_mwh']-bw['fac_mwh'])*1e3*wi/1e6)/r['ons_saved'] for wi in wi_sweep]\n    tr_s.append({'x': wi_sweep, 'y': frac, 'type': 'scatter', 'mode': 'lines',\n                 'name': s, 'line': {'color': colors[s], 'width': 3}})\nshapes = [{'type': 'line', 'x0': v, 'x1': v, 'y0': 0, 'y1': 1, 'yref': 'paper',\n           'line': {'color': 'gray', 'dash': 'dot', 'width': 1}} for v in (0.776, 2.60, 4.35)]\nmplot(tr_s, layout=_cooling_plot_layout({'title': {'text': '敏感性：被归属发电耗水抵消的补水量'},\n    'xaxis': {'title': '电网水耗强度 (L/kWh，运行消耗量)'},\n    'yaxis': {'title': '补水节约抵消比例 (%)', 'range': [0, 105]},\n    'shapes': shapes,\n    'annotations': [{'x': 0.776, 'y': 1.02, 'yref': 'paper', 'text': '燃气联合循环', 'showarrow': False, 'font': {'size': 10}},\n                    {'x': 2.60, 'y': 1.02, 'yref': 'paper', 'text': '煤电', 'showarrow': False, 'font': {'size': 10}},\n                    {'x': 4.35, 'y': 1.02, 'yref': 'paper', 'text': '美国 2023（含水电）', 'showarrow': False, 'font': {'size': 10}}],\n    'legend': {'orientation': 'h', 'y': -0.2}}))\n",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "python",
        "name": "analysis_plots"
      },
      {
        "code": "## 将对比理解为一种权衡，而非绝对优势声明\n\n仿真打印出**当前**假设下的结果；此处特意未对数值结论进行硬编码。改变盘管、蓄水层、天气、循环回路极限或电–水因子都可能改变其先后次序。修正后的冷凝器包含了潜热，因此最初仅考虑显热的计算结果不具可比性。\n\n- **能耗：**矿井回收系统在湿式基准的基础上增加了盘管风机和矿井水泵的耗电量。两个系统均包含相同的条件热泵。先前 `extra` 指标包含了该热泵并除以 IT 耗电量；它**并非**回收系统与湿式基准之间的增量能耗差异。请使用 `dFac%` 进行匹配的设施能耗对比。\n- **水耗：**`WUEsrc` 为每 IT kWh 的现场冷却塔补给水量加上归属发电水耗。`net_saved` 结果为该特定混合核算指标的减少量——而非总消耗水量的核实节约量。冷却塔补给水包括蒸发、飘水和排污；排污回流未被建模。请同时对比该指标与设施能耗：干式冷却方案可能会消耗更多电能，但其指标数值却低于矿井回收系统，因此两种方案都不必在两个目标上均占据绝对优势。\n- **规模与时间：**年化总值大约将相同的模拟高温周重复 52.1 次。它们不是全年的气象模拟、长期矿井预测或特定地点的环境评估。\n- **电网敏感性：**绘制的发电水耗因子仅为说明性的历史参考值，而非针对特定购电合同的预测。4.35 L/kWh 的参考值包含了水电站水库蒸发的分配额；计算边界与分摊方法的选择至关重要。\n- **可行性：**有利的玩具模型结果并非设备可行性的证据。实际评估需要经过校准的湿盘管模型、压降曲线、矿井水力学与补给、水质/卫生控制、季节性天气以及一致的水资源消耗核算。\n\n### 参考阅读与文献归属\n\n- Shehabi 等人，*2024 United States Data Center Energy Usage Report*，劳伦斯伯克利国家实验室/DOE：[报告记录](https://bies.lbl.gov/publications/2024-lbnl-data-center-energy-usage-report)。\n- Macknick 等人，*Operational water consumption and withdrawal factors for electricity generating technologies: a review of existing literature* (2012)：[DOI 10.1088/1748-9326/7/4/045802](https://doi.org/10.1088/1748-9326/7/4/045802)。消耗量与取水量是不同的物理量：电网因子属于消耗量，而现场冷却塔补给水则包含排污。两者的总和是明确定义的混合核算指标，而非总消耗水量。\n- *Water-energy tradeoffs in data centers: A case study in hot-arid climates* (2022)：[DOI 10.1016/j.resconrec.2022.106194](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.resconrec.2022.106194)。它描述的是其他设施，并非对此矿井概念的验证。\n- [EnergyPlus 工程参考，冷却盘管](https://energyplus.readthedocs.io/en/latest/guides/engineering-reference/15.2-coils.html)：湿盘管排热包括显热和潜热贡献。本工作簿基于能量限制的近似方法要简单得多，并非 EnergyPlus 模型。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "conclusions"
      }
    ]
  }
}
